  "kind": "definition",
  "title": "Weil group and degree",
  "statement": "For a geometrically connected separated finite-type $k_0$-scheme\n$X_0$ with $X=X_0\\times_{k_0}k$, the *Weil group*\n$W(X_0)$ appearing in the Weil fundamental representation of\n[def-wf-fundamental-representation] is the inverse image of the infinite cyclic subgroup\ngenerated by the geometric Frobenius $\\Phi_X$ of\n[def-tw-frobenius-action] inside the arithmetic\nfundamental group, and the\n*degree map* is the resulting projection\n$\\deg:W(X_0)\\to\\mathbf Z$, which records the exponent of $\\Phi_X$.",
